Template: unify-desktop-assistant/unify-key
Type: string
Default:
Description: Unify API Key
 Enter your Unify API key. This key is used to authenticate with the Unify
 platform and is also used as the VNC password for the desktop viewer.
 .
 You can change this later from the system tray icon menu (Settings).

Template: unify-desktop-assistant/orchestra-url
Type: string
Default: https://api.unify.ai/v0
Description: Orchestra URL
 The URL for the Unify Orchestra API endpoint.
 .
 Leave as default unless you know you need a different endpoint.

Template: unify-desktop-assistant/unity-comms-url
Type: string
Default: https://unity-comms-app-000000000000.us-central1.run.app
Description: Unity Comms URL
 The URL for the Unity Communications service.
 .
 Leave as default unless you know you need a different endpoint.
